  "weakest_point": "prim_multibit_sync is the generic multibit consistency-check synchronizer behind the remaining sync-family gap. The first gate fixes Width=8 and NumChecks=2, so it does not prove all widths, all NumChecks values, MuBi wrapper StabilityCheck behavior, life-cycle typed sync, full CDC correctness, raw full-state equality, or zero-initialized GPU correctness.",
