    "the fourteenth primitive review accepted generated MuBi sync wrappers only with StabilityCheck disabled",
    "prim_multibit_sync directly targets the remaining generic consistency-check synchronizer gap without moving to life-cycle packages or alert/esc protocols",
    "it is source-backed, small enough for one gate, and depends mainly on the already active prim_flop_2sync path",
    "planned parameters Width=8 and NumChecks=2 exercise the consistency-check path while keeping the first gate bounded",
    "it does not restore archived XuanTie-E902 or VeeR-EL2 source",
    "it should reuse the shared Verilator/GPU/runtime flow without target-specific runtime hooks"
  ],
